    <title><![CDATA[Mondiale - Airfreight BDM]]></title>
    <date><![CDATA[Fri, 13 Mar 2026 06:30:13 +0000]]></date>
    <referencenumber><![CDATA[86]]></referencenumber>
    <url><![CDATA[https://www.advanzea.com.au/job-details/mondiale-airfreight-bdm-in-sales-jobs-1465941]]></url>
    <company><![CDATA[Advanzea]]></company>
    <sourcename><![CDATA[Shazamme]]></sourcename>
    <city><![CDATA[Sydney]]></city>
    <state><![CDATA[NSW]]></state>
    <country><![CDATA[Australia]]></country>
    <postalcode><![CDATA[]]></postalcode>
    <description><![CDATA[<div style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"> Mondiale VGL is a globally recognised transport and logistics provider with roots in Oceania and operations in 19 markets.
<p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">For over 40 years, we&rsquo;ve connected people, places and possibilities - moving freight and building careers across New Zealand, Australia, Asia, Europe and the USA.</p>
<p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">We offer fully integrated, end-to-end logistics services, including sea and air freight, import and export, wharf transport, customs clearance, and warehousing.</p>
<p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">Our scale and reach help businesses operate more efficiently across borders and supply chains &ndash; and our team of 1,500+ people brings diverse perspectives and shared ambition.</p>
<p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">We&rsquo;re proud of our heritage and the platform it provides for people and businesses to grow. Be part of a company that gets things moving &ndash; and build a career that moves with it.</p>
<strong style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Job Description </strong>
<p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">We&rsquo;re looking for a driven and strategic Airfreight Business Development Manager to accelerate growth across our Melbourne and Sydney markets. This is a high-impact sales role focused on expanding our airfreight customer base, increasing revenue, and delivering tailored logistics solutions that leverage our global network. If you're passionate about sales, thrive in a fast-paced environment, and have a deep understanding of international airfreight, this is your opportunity to make a significant mark.</p>
<p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;"><strong style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Key Responsibilities </strong></p>
<ul style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Drive New Business: Identify, pursue, and secure new airfreight customers through proactive prospecting, networking, and lead generation.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Client Engagement: Build strong relationships with key decision-makers, understand their logistics needs, and present compelling solutions.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Sales Strategy: Develop and execute regional sales plans aligned with company targets and market opportunities.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Solution Selling: Collaborate with internal teams to craft customised airfreight solutions that meet client requirements and deliver value.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Pipeline Management: Maintain a robust sales pipeline using CRM tools, ensuring accurate forecasting and reporting.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Market Intelligence: Stay ahead of industry trends, competitor activity, and customer expectations to inform strategy and positioning.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Revenue Growth: Consistently meet or exceed sales targets and contribute to the overall profitability of the airfreight division.</li>
</ul>
<strong style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Qualifications </strong>
<ul style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Proven success in B2B sales within freight forwarding, logistics, or airfreight (minimum 5 years).</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Strong commercial acumen and negotiation skills.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Deep understanding of international airfreight operations, pricing, and compliance.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Excellent communication and presentation abilities.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Self-motivated, results-oriented, and comfortable working independently.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Proficiency in CRM systems and Microsoft Office Suite.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Tertiary qualifications in Business, Logistics, or related fields (preferred).</li>
</ul>
<strong style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Additional Information </strong>
<p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;"><strong style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Why Mondiale VGL? </strong></p>
<ul style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-size: 14px;">
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Be part of a dynamic and growing team in a global company with over 40 years of industry expertise</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Join a supportive, energetic environment where no two days are the same</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Competitive base salary + uncapped commission structure.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Career development within a global logistics leader.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Supportive team culture and leadership.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Access to cutting-edge logistics technology and global resources.</li>
<li style="font-size: 14px;">Opportunity to work overseas.</li>
</ul>
</div>]]></description>
